/-!
# A063008

Canonical partition sequence (see A080577) encoded by prime factorization. The partition [p1,p2,p3,...] with p1 >= p2 >= p3 >= ... is encoded as 2^p1 * 3^p2 * 5^p3 * ... .

The 52 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A063008

